  "generator_note_accel_central_difference": {
    "finding": "xrperil_multi._sim_user_track computes accel with np.gradient (central difference), so accel[t] depends on speed[t+1]. The label at t depends only on speed[t] (via optic_flow), yaw_rate[t] and latency[t], so this does not carry label information, but it is a non-causal telemetry channel; see ablation victim_all_no_accel in analyze_detection."
